sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser (SPA)
    participant AuthProxy as Auth Proxy<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.3
    participant BFF as Go BFF<br/>8080/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Gateway as OpenShell Gateway<br/>50051/TCP gRPC TLS 1.2+

    Note over Browser,Gateway: Flow 1: Authenticated User Request
    Browser->>AuthProxy: GET /api/v1/workspaces<br/>OIDC session cookie
    AuthProxy->>AuthProxy: Validate session<br/>Extract bearer token
    AuthProxy->>BFF: GET /api/v1/workspaces<br/>x-forwarded-access-token: {jwt}
    BFF->>BFF: Extract token from header<br/>Set Authorization: Bearer
    BFF->>Gateway: gRPC ListWorkspaces<br/>Bearer token (forwarded)
    Gateway->>Gateway: Validate JWT (OIDC JWKS)<br/>Enforce workspace RBAC
    Gateway-->>BFF: WorkspaceList response
    BFF-->>AuthProxy: JSON response
    AuthProxy-->>Browser: JSON response

    Note over Browser,Gateway: Flow 2: WebSocket Terminal Session
    Browser->>AuthProxy: WSS /api/v1/workspaces/{ws}/sandboxes/{name}/terminal<br/>OIDC session cookie
    AuthProxy->>BFF: WS Upgrade<br/>x-forwarded-access-token: {jwt}
    BFF->>Gateway: gRPC ExecSandboxInteractive<br/>bidi-stream, Bearer (forwarded)
    loop Interactive Terminal
        Browser->>BFF: WS frame (stdin)
        BFF->>Gateway: gRPC stream (input)
        Gateway-->>BFF: gRPC stream (output)
        BFF-->>Browser: WS frame (stdout/stderr)
    end

    Note over Browser,Gateway: Flow 3: Binary File Upload
    Browser->>AuthProxy: POST /api/v1/workspaces/{ws}/sandboxes/{name}/files<br/>multipart/form-data
    AuthProxy->>BFF: HTTP multipart<br/>x-forwarded-access-token: {jwt}
    BFF->>Gateway: gRPC ExecSandboxInteractive<br/>bidi-stream, tty=false
    loop 256 KiB Chunks
        BFF->>Gateway: gRPC stream (file chunk)
    end
    Gateway-->>BFF: Exec result
    BFF-->>AuthProxy: Upload response
    AuthProxy-->>Browser: Upload response
